      "excerpt": "Emergency services attended an incident in Middleton town centre involving a man on a roof, leading to a significant police presence in the area.",
      "content_html": "<p>Emergency services responded to an incident in Middleton town centre on Tuesday afternoon, involving a man on a roof. Police and other emergency services arrived at the scene, creating a significant presence in the area.</p><p>Witnesses reported seeing emergency vehicles and personnel surrounding the location as efforts were made to resolve the situation. The nature of the incident has not been disclosed, and no injuries have been reported.</p><p>Authorities have cordoned off the area while they manage the situation. Local residents and businesses may experience disruptions as a result of the ongoing response.</p><p>Further updates will be provided as more information becomes available.</p>",
